195
00:19:59,470 --> 00:20:03,970
Rym: Yup, but they won a lot of games in the second half of the season.

196
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:08,370
Scott: It's all, well, no, the problem is OT points, right?

197
00:20:08,430 --> 00:20:12,510
