342
00:32:58,400 --> 00:33:03,800
Scott: And all of them, they look like 3D glasses from the movie theater, but not even the plastic kind.

343
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:08,300
Scott: They're like the cardboard kind with two little cellophane lenses.

344
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:13,320
Rym: And while they're all official ones that look like that, I would not trust anything you could buy from Amazon.

345
00:33:13,521 --> 00:33:15,453
Scott: All of these ones on Amazon.

346
00:33:15,473 --> 00:33:16,418
Scott: Here's the top result.

347
00:33:16,459 --> 00:33:16,660
Scott: Ready?

348
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:28,260
Scott: Medical King Solar Eclipse glasses, AAS approved 2024 10 pack, CE and ISO certified safe shades for direct sun viewing.

349
00:33:28,800 --> 00:33:30,056
Scott: They also show you in the picture.

350
00:33:30,601 --> 00:33:34,860
Rym: I'm going to go on a limb and if someone sues me over this statement, then all right, let's go.

351
00:33:35,684 --> 00:33:37,459
Rym: I am very confident those are fake.

352
00:33:38,700 --> 00:33:49,600
Scott: I am very, I am, I'm not, I do not believe that they are telling the truth about the certifications and the safety.

353
00:33:49,881 --> 00:33:51,704
