Scott: GeekNights is recorded live with no studio and no audience.

716
00:57:20,782 --> 00:57:24,230
Scott: But unlike those other late shows, it's actually recorded at night.

717
00:57:24,630 --> 00:57:45,327
Rym: And the Patreon patrons for this April 2nd episode of GeekNights are... I am super hungry so I'm just going to stop right now and I'm just going to leave you tonight with...

718
00:57:47,410 --> 00:57:48,892
Scott: I kind of like talking like this but I don't.

719
00:57:48,912 --> 00:57:49,933
Scott: I bet chicks like it too.

720
00:57:57,330 --> 00:57:59,078
Rym: Oh, I didn't even think of that.

721
00:58:00,621 --> 00:58:02,732
Scott: Hey baby, would you like to come back?

722
00:58:04,620 --> 00:58:06,248
Scott: I can talk even quieter than this.

723
00:58:07,294 --> 00:58:08,540
Scott: You won't even know I'm in the room.

724
00:58:10,840 --> 00:58:11,076
Scott: Oh yeah.

